menu "CFS-MCU configuration"

    config CFS_HAS_INA219
        bool "INA219 power sensor present (C2b hardware)"
        default n
        help
            Compile the INA219 I2C power-sensor driver and enable the `POWER`
            serial command. Leave OFF until the C2b measurement hardware
            (INA219 in series on the 5V rail) is wired. When OFF the driver is
            still compiled inert-free (excluded) and `POWER on` reports that no
            sensor is configured.

    config CFS_INA219_SDA_GPIO
        int "INA219 I2C SDA GPIO"
        depends on CFS_HAS_INA219
        default 1
        help
            SDA pin for the INA219. Default GPIO1. If it clashes with the
            detected camera pin map, change here AND record the change in the
            README wiring guide.

    config CFS_INA219_SCL_GPIO
        int "INA219 I2C SCL GPIO"
        depends on CFS_HAS_INA219
        default 2
        help
            SCL pin for the INA219. Default GPIO2.

    config CFS_INA219_ADDR
        hex "INA219 I2C address"
        depends on CFS_HAS_INA219
        default 0x40

endmenu
